<SECTION SCID = "T120012A815S"><script xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" src="/_runtime/xslt-polyfill.min.js"></script><SCTITLE/>

<PARA INFOID = "T120012A815" UPDATE = "ORIGINAL" LDUP = "28Apr2005"     INFOTYPE = "SYSTEM" INDSW = "ON" SELECT = "Vehicle Outline: Comfort and Usability">
<TITLE>HDD Navigation System</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>An HDD (hard disk drive) is installed in the multi-display, and a newly adopted sound library function can record approximately 100 CDs to the hard disk by inserting CDs.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>By adopting a CD text display function, information pre-entered on the CD being played (artist name, track name, etc.) can be displayed. In addition, a built-in MDLP (Long Play) compatible MD player enables playback of MDs recorded on MDLP compatible decks, etc., providing excellent functionality.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>CDs recorded in WMA (Windows Media Audio) and MP3 (MPEG Audio Layer 3) formats can be played<HINTREF     REFID = "H403120012A81501"/>, improving marketability.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>An automatic sound levelizer function has been adopted, providing excellent usability.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>Serviceability has been improved by adopting a IEEE1394 standard HDD update connector.</PTXT>
<HINT>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>Depending on the device used for recording, some CD-Rs and CD-RWs may not play.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1></HINT></ITEM></LIST1>
<FIGURE>
<GRAPHIC GRAPHICNAME = "a4740041e" WIDTH = "6.903in" HEIGHT = "2.764in" />
</FIGURE>
<SPEC ID = "T120012A815X01" INDSW = "OFF">
<TITLE>HDD Navigation System Specifications</TITLE>
<TABLE FRAME = "ALL" COLSEP = "1" ROWSEP = "1">
<TGROUP COLS = "2" COLSEP = "1" ROWSEP = "1" TGROUPSTYLE = "Table_10">
<COLSPEC COLNUM = "1" COLNAME = "1" COLWIDTH = "17%"/>
<COLSPEC COLNUM = "2" COLNAME = "2" COLWIDTH = "82%"/>
<THEAD>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Type</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Function</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
</THEAD>
<TBODY>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Radio</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>PLL synthesizer tuning. Manual preset: up to 6 stations each for AM/FM. Auto preset: up to 6 stations each for AM/FM. Automatic reception sensitivity switching (AM). Traffic information reception.</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>DISC(CD)</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>FAST UP/DOWN。 DISC UP/DOWN。 TRACK UP/DOWN。 DISC RANDOM。 TRACK RANDOM。 DISC RPT。 TRACK RPT。 DISC SCAN。 TRACK SCAN。 CD text display function.</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>MD</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>TRACK UP/DOWN。 FAST UP/DOWN。 MD GROUP UP/DOWN。 TRACK RANDOM。 MD GROUP RANDOM。 TRACK RPT。 MD GROUP RPT。 TRACK SCAN。 MD GROUP SCAN。 MD title display function. MDLP playback function.</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1"><PTXT>Music CD (MP3/WMA)</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>FAST UP/DOWN。 DISC UP/DOWN。 FOLDER UP/DOWN。 FILE UP/DOWN。 RANDOM within DISC. RANDOM within FOLDER. FOLDER RPT。 FILE RPT。 FOLDER SCAN。 FILE SCAN。 Folder list display. File list display.</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "1">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1"><PTXT>HDD Audio (Sound Library)</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2"><PTXT>RANDOM within playlist. RANDOM within play mode. Current track RPT. Playlist RPT. Text display function.</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
<ROW ROWSEP = "0">
<ENTRY COLNAME = "1" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Others</PTXT></ENTRY>
<ENTRY COLNAME = "2" CONSPIC = "0"><PTXT>Direct source change. Built-in FIX equalizer. Automatic sound levelizer function. LIVE-ACS function. Maximum total output 160W (40W x 4).</PTXT></ENTRY>
</ROW>
</TBODY>
</TGROUP></TABLE></SPEC>
</PARA>
<BIND ID = "T120012A815B" INDSW = "OFF">
<TITLE>Related Parts</TITLE>

